  {
   "id": "math.geometric-mean",
   "name": "Geometric means",
   "requires": [],
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "If a, m, b are in a geometric sequence, m is a geometric mean of a and b. Equal ratios m/a = b/m give m² = ab, so m = ±√(ab). For three terms with a known product, write them as a/r, a, ar: the r cancels in the product."
    },
    "am": {
     "text": "a, m, b ጂኦሜትሪክ ቅደም ተከተል ከሆኑ m የ a እና b ጂኦሜትሪክ አማካይ ነው። m² = ab ስለሆነ m = ±√(ab)።",
     "machine": true
    }
   },
   "screens": [
