      "r = m/a = b/m, so m² = ab."
     ],
     "note": "m = ±√(ab), with a, b, m ≠ 0.",
     "ref": "p.19",
     "id": "g12.maths.u1.s1-2-2.25"
    },
    {
     "kind": "name",
     "step": "name",
     "title": "Key words",
     "defs": [
      [
       "Geometric mean",
       "A term m between a and b in a geometric sequence; m = ±√(ab)."
